Tika 只做两件事：探测 MIME、抽纯文本：
```java
private static final Tika TIKA = new Tika();
...
text = TIKA.parseToString(is);
text = TextCleanupUtil.cleanup(text);
```
平文本没有结构，只能按连续空行切段，且只产 ParagraphBlock：
```java
for (String segment : text.split("\\n{2,}")) {
    String trimmed = segment.strip();
    if (trimmed.isEmpty()) {
        continue;
    }
    blocks.add(new ParagraphBlock(prov, trimmed));
}
```
认领范围刻意收窄：text/* 通配只兜长尾，其余精确键让给更专门的解析器：
```java
return Map.of(ParseProfile.FAST, Set.of(
        "text/*",
        "text/html",
        "application/json",
        "application/xml",
        "application/xhtml+xml",
        "application/rtf"
));
```
